  "notes": "Labels use GPIO names with the silkscreen number and CircuitPython name (IOnn) first in functions; Power Domain tags (RTC, CPU, SPI/CPU) omitted, as are the red square icon after MTMS and the battery +/- polarity symbols. Top pad of the left power header has no callout and no silkscreen (unlabeled, kept as \"?\"). DEBUG_TX and MISO are both printed as GPIO37/FSPIQ; copied as printed. Unlabeled 2x5 header beside USB, DC jack, ON/OFF switch, RESET and DFU buttons, NeoPixel and status LEDs skipped."
